{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub039_policef_01",
      "hash": "426534fabe078478",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "最近我捉到一隻\\n老是惡作劇的傑尼龜！\\c\\n要是能遇到個能幹的訓練家，\\n我想把這孩子交給他照顧……"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub039_policef_06",
      "hash": "42653bfabe07905d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哦～[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳至今為止捉到的寶可夢\\n有[VAR NUM9(0000,0000)]隻啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub039_policef_02",
      "hash": "426537fabe078991",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "看來[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳……\\n似乎是個能幹的訓練家！\\c\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳願意收下這隻\\n難搞的傑尼龜嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub039_policef_03",
      "hash": "426536fabe0787de",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "拜託[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳了！\\n要好好培育牠喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub039_policef_07",
      "hash": "42653afabe078eaa",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "當[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳捉到[VAR NUM3(0000)]隻寶可夢之後，\\n我再拜託[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_sub039_policef_04",
      "hash": "426539fabe078cf7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這下該怎麼辦呢……\\n真頭痛……"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_sub039_policef_05",
      "hash": "426538fabe078b44",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "傑尼龜\\n過得好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_sub039_poke_01",
      "hash": "fe599006e0672827",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "傑尼龜「傑尼傑尼 ～"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_sub_event_039_max",
